# Mosquitto ACL for ha-timekprnext. Copy the relevant blocks into your broker's acl_file.
# Host ids and kid ids share the `timekpr/` namespace: they must never be equal.

# --- one block per client PC (user = tk-agent-<client-host>) -------------------
user tk-agent-<client-host>
# own usage, status (LWT) and events
topic write timekpr/<client-host>/#
# HA discovery for the PC's online sensor
topic write homeassistant/binary_sensor/tk_<client-host>/#
# budget output for all kids
topic read timekpr/+/remaining
topic read timekpr/+/settings

# --- tk-budget add-on ----------------------------------------------------------
user tk-budget
topic read timekpr/#
topic write timekpr/+/remaining
topic write timekpr/+/settings
topic write timekpr/+/state
topic write timekpr/_budget/status
topic write homeassistant/#

# --- Home Assistant (MQTT integration user) ------------------------------------
user homeassistant
topic read timekpr/#
topic read homeassistant/#
topic write homeassistant/#
# dashboard buttons, number and select
topic write timekpr/+/cmd
topic write timekpr/+/set/#
